    "summary": "Penannular collar; worn by women. Composed of multiple strings of black, red, white and green plastic beads arranged in bands and threaded onto a continuous length of metal wire. The outer row has a repeating pattern of a single larger white plastic bead separated by three small black beads. The rows of beads are divided by vertical twisted metal spacers. The sides of the collar are finished with white plastic strips. A length of twisted natural coloured cotton thread is tied to one side and used for securing the collar when in use.",
